  "_comment": "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for access tiers and the capability matrix. Read by the renderer (src/services/accessControl.js), the Electron main process (electron/lib/capability.cjs) and the Express server (server/routes/auth.cjs). JSON so all three runtimes can consume it without a build step. Lower tier number = higher privilege; a capability's value is the LOWEST-privileged tier still allowed to use it.",
